    "detailed_description": "<h1>Buzz</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/8d7777ed824c22a47f997552497405f4.avif?t=1753495126\" width=620 height=206 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/2abde9e8fb9eaef27f481674966ddb86.avif?t=1753495126\" width=168 height=154 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/00922b3947faddf0bed7a0aef5e1c730.avif?t=1753495126\" width=274 height=154 /></span><br><br>&quot;... grabs you right from the start.&quot; - LVLOne<br><br>&quot;...an engaging experience.&quot; - Lords of Gaming<br><br>&quot;You can always tell a boss means business when it comes with a subtitle.&quot; - Game Informer<br><br>\u201cChock full of great moments and interesting battle mechanics.\u201d - blogcritics</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robots at Midnight</strong> is a retro-futuristic Action RPG set on the ruined planet of Yob, a luxury world now left in decay and haunted by the machines once built to serve it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After twenty years in cryo-sleep, Zoe wakes to find a world she barely recognizes. To survive and to save what\u2019s left, she must track down her missing father, lost during the cataclysmic event known only as The Blackout. Along the way, she\u2019ll take on gangs of corrupted robots, confront towering bosses, and uncover long-buried truths about Yob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just be home before midnight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Combat with Fluid Movement\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/6c4f2f74cb2c2d90f499d1d329c9356f.poster.avif?t=1753495126\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/6c4f2f74cb2c2d90f499d1d329c9356f.webm?t=1753495126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/6c4f2f74cb2c2d90f499d1d329c9356f.mp4?t=1753495126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Harness the power of your space-gauntlet, <strong>The MITT-\u00a0</strong>an old-world tool built for space exploration, now repurposed for survival. Launch off enemies, soar through the air, and smash through bots with momentum-based combat that keeps you constantly in motion. Whether exploring or in the heat of battle, fluid traversal is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your rhythm. Sharpen your skills. Discover what you\u2019re really made of.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Choose Your Challenge\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/78fca1b619fb0731591a4d82390c82d3.poster.avif?t=1753495126\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/78fca1b619fb0731591a4d82390c82d3.webm?t=1753495126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/78fca1b619fb0731591a4d82390c82d3.mp4?t=1753495126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Whether you're \u00a0new to action RPGs or a seasoned fighter, <strong>Robots at Midnight</strong> adapts to your playstyle. <strong>Hero Mode</strong> offers a more forgiving, story-focused experience, while <strong>Master Mode</strong> brings high-stakes intensity for those seeking a true test of reflexes and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whichever path you choose, prepare for a fight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Explore and Uncover Hidden Lore\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/645986072705fca44994b5990d906d6a.poster.avif?t=1753495126\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/645986072705fca44994b5990d906d6a.webm?t=1753495126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/645986072705fca44994b5990d906d6a.mp4?t=1753495126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Waking up on a ruined planet is just the beginning. Step into Zoe\u2019s sneakers and investigate the world around you. Discover lost technologies, piece together the story of Yob\u2019s downfall, and decide your place in a future that moved on without you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/e51b7255f9d595b029a6b29bd5bee929.poster.avif?t=1753495126\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/e51b7255f9d595b029a6b29bd5bee929.webm?t=1753495126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/e51b7255f9d595b029a6b29bd5bee929.mp4?t=1753495126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To stay updated on <i>Robots at Midnight</i>, follow us on socials, join our Discord, and sign up for our newsletter! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Robots at Midnight</strong> is a retro-futuristic Action RPG set on the ruined planet of Yob, a luxury world now left in decay and haunted by the machines once built to serve it.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After twenty years in cryo-sleep, Zoe wakes to find a world she barely recognizes. To survive and to save what\u2019s left, she must track down her missing father, lost during the cataclysmic event known only as The Blackout. Along the way, she\u2019ll take on gangs of corrupted robots, confront towering bosses, and uncover long-buried truths about Yob.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just be home before midnight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Combat with Fluid Movement\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/6c4f2f74cb2c2d90f499d1d329c9356f.poster.avif?t=1753495126\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/6c4f2f74cb2c2d90f499d1d329c9356f.webm?t=1753495126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2623040/extras/6c4f2f74cb2c2d90f499d1d329c9356f.mp4?t=1753495126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Harness the power of your space-gauntlet, <strong>The MITT-\u00a0</strong>an old-world tool built for space exploration, now repurposed for survival. Launch off enemies, soar through the air, and smash through bots with momentum-based combat that keeps you constantly in motion. Whether exploring or in the heat of battle, fluid traversal is your greatest weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your rhythm. Sharpen your skills. Discover what you\u2019re really made of.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Choose Your Challenge\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"